<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<%- include('partials/meta/header') %>
<body class="privacy-policy-body">
    <div class="privacy-policy-container">
        <div class="privacy-policy-card">
            <div class="privacy-policy-card-header">
                <div class="privacy-policy-header-left">
                    <h3>Privacy Policy</h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="privacy-policy-card-body">
                <form class="privacy-policy-form">
                    <div class="privacy-policy-additional">
                        <label class="privacy-policy-text">
                            CDLC Happiness App Privacy Policy<br><br>
                            1. Introduction<br>
                            CDLC Consultants (“Company”) is committed to protecting the privacy of its employees. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect use and protect personal information obtained through the CDLC Happiness App (“Software”).<br><br>
                            2. Information Collection<br>
                            2.1. Personal Information: The Company may collect personal information such as names contact details job titles and other work-related information from employees using the Software.<br>
                            2.2. Usage Data: The Company may collect data on how employees use the Software including login times features accessed and other usage metrics.<br><br>
                            3. Use of Information<br>
                            3.1. Purpose: The collected information is used solely for work-related purposes including improving the Software ensuring compliance with Company policies and enhancing employee experience.<br>
                            3.2. Internal Use: The information collected is used internally by the Company and is not shared with third parties except as required by law.<br><br>
                            4. Data Protection<br>
                            4.1. Security Measures: The Company employs industry-standard security measures to protect personal information from unauthorized access disclosure alteration and destruction.<br>
                            4.2. Access Control: Access to personal information is restricted to authorized personnel only and is provided on a need-to-know basis.<br><br>
                            5. Data Retention<br>
                            The Company retains personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy or as required by law.<br><br>
                            6. Employee Rights<br>
                            6.1. Access and Correction: Employees have the right to access and correct their personal information held by the Company. Requests for access or correction should be directed to the Company’s IT department.<br>
                            6.2. Data Deletion: Employees may request the deletion of their personal information subject to the Company’s legal obligations and legitimate business interests.<br><br>
                            7. Changes to the Privacy Policy<br>
                            The Company reserves the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Employees will be notified of any changes and continued use of the Software constitutes acceptance of the revised Privacy Policy.<br><br>
                            8. Contact Information<br>
                            For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy please contact the Company’s legal department at:<br><br>
                            CDLC Consultants<br>
                            900 Technology Way Suite 301<br>
                            Libertyville IL 60048<br>
                            Email: info@cdlconsultants.com<br>
                            Phone: 615-696-7161
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="privacy-policy-submit-button">
                        <input type="button" value="Close" class="btn privacy-policy-btn" onclick="window.location.href='/register'">
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <%- include('partials/meta/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
